{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S03-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B1.1\", \"B1.2\", \"B1.3\", \"B1.4\", \"B1.5\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"亲近带来的舒服不再催促他去往哪里，而是让他停留在相处本身：身体被摇曳托住，意识微醺游离，连沉默也自在，心却不知不觉慢慢漂远。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\"S03-1\"],\n      \"beads\": [\"B2.1\", \"B2.2\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"到了20–21小节，安稳的摇曳里忽然冒出几句短促急切的声音，像开口的念头刚浮起就沉回去；亲近中的轻松仍在延续，这一点冲动没有发展成真正的倾诉。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\"B3.1\", \"B3.2\", \"B3.3\", \"B3.4\", \"B3.5\", \"B3.6\"],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"同一片摇曳也透出另一侧的阻力：水波像被拖住，20–22小节的声音绕远滞留，思绪碎散，亲密触到未解之结；但这种不顺并未骤然变成悲剧。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"why\": \"亲近带来的舒适使他沉浸于相处本身，身体与心思都停留在摇曳、漂浮的状态；这份轻松也让短暂浮起的开口冲动很快沉回去，没有发展成真正的倾诉。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B3\",\n      \"why\": \"这些珠子呈现的是顺畅中的阻滞、思绪的破碎以及亲密处的未解之结，而S03-1只交代了亲近带来的舒适与沉浸，没有说明这些阻力从何而来，因此应保留为同一段音乐的另一侧面，不强行纳入线的因果。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7502dbd0-0355-4bae-9df9-ea62ef97474b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T113942904920Z", "elapsed_seconds": 125.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T11:41:48.411692+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a7d263a862ced0dd311ee0dcafcdb3c1c08eec646055fb44781eaa1fc1d4ee9d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true